        {
          "id": "docx-n5-be11a1fdb4c4c3df231bb2fb",
          "alias": "饮用变大药水",
          "prompt": "2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene in a cozy wooden-floored room.in the top-left panel,a close-up of a dusty wooden floor,where a small glass vial lies on its side,filled with a shimmering golden liquid,with a tiny paper label tied around its neck bearing the chinese characters “喝我” (drink me) in elegant ink.in the top-right panel,a girl crouches down,picking up the vial with both hands,examining it with a mix of curiosity and amusement,then uncorks it and brings it to her lips.in the bottom-left panel,she has just swallowed the liquid,her eyes widening as her body begins to expand—her shoulders broaden,her legs stretch,and she rises rapidly,her clothes straining.in the bottom-right panel,from a low angle,she is now towering over the room,her head bumping against the ceiling,and her shoulder accidentally knocks over a large wooden chair beside her,sending it clattering to the floor. she looks down with a surprised,slightly apologetic expression.the overall mood is playful,magical,and gently chaotic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_41381_饮用变大药水.jpg",
