          "prompt": "2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene in a cozy,magical cottage at sunrise.in the top-left panel,a close-up of a bubbling glass flask filled with shimmering blue liquid,tiny golden sparks rising from the surface.in the top-right panel,a young witch in a patched cloak holds a wooden stirring rod,gently swirling the potion with a focused,tender expression.in the bottom-left panel,she tips a single drop of the potion onto a wilted flower in a small pot on the windowsill.in the bottom-right panel,the flower instantly unfurls into a glowing,vibrant bloom,its petals catching the morning light,and the witch smiles softly.the overall mood is quiet,magical,and full of gentle wonder.",
