          "alias": "吃掉缩小蛋糕",
          "prompt": "5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene in a cozy,warmly lit kitchen.in the top-left panel,a close-up of a small,delicate cake on a wooden plate,topped with a dollop of cream and a tiny tag that reads “eat me” in elegant script.in the top-right panel,a girl sits at the table,her finger hovering over the tag,a look of playful curiosity on her face before she brings a forkful of the cake to her lips.in the bottom-left panel,she suddenly shrinks rapidly,her clothes becoming loose,and now stands tiny on the tablecloth,looking around in surprise.in the bottom-right panel,from a low angle,she stands at the edge of the table,gazing up at a giant wooden chair beside the table,its legs towering like pillars,her expression a mix of awe and wonder.the overall mood is whimsical,slightly surreal,and filled with a sense of miniature adventure.",
