          "alias": "骑着扫帚奔向月亮",
          "prompt": "2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,15::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,不要均分四格,a four-panel manga-style scene in a moonlit meadow.in the top-left panel,a worn but sturdy broomstick leans against an old oak tree,its twigs slightly frayed,with a small lantern tied to the handle.in the top-right panel,a girl in a flowy dress swings one leg over the broom,gripping it nervously but with sparkling eyes.in the bottom-left panel,the broom lifts a few inches off the ground,wobbling as she steadies herself,her hair lifted by a soft breeze.in the bottom-right panel,she soars upward,silhouetted against a full moon,a trail of silver dust streaming behind her,her face alight with joy.the overall mood is adventurous,exhilarating,and dreamy.",
