          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "indian style,naked towel,holding ice cream,licking,a steam-filled sauna surrounds the girl,wooden benches glowing amber under soft lighting. she leans against cedar walls,wisps of vapor clinging to her relaxed posture as droplets trail down heated rocks. birch branches release a faint woody fragrance,blending with the rhythmic crackle of burning logs in the corner furnace. sunlight filters through a small frosted window,casting soft geometric patterns on the mist. the girl sits quietly with eyes closed,her breath syncing with the hiss of water splashing on scorched stones. warmth radiates from terracotta tiles beneath her feet while condensation drips along copper pipes overhead.",
          "description": "",
