          "id": "docx-n45-1a154715af25f2205366a1aa",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a girl stands amidst twisted vines with glowing eyes,her bare feet entangled by thorny roots emerging from cracked soil. jagged branches spiral around her torso like skeletal hands,their bark pulsating with faint crimson veins. clusters of bioluminescent flowers bloom nearby,petals releasing shimmering spores that cling to her torn dress. shadowy cat-like creatures with glowing amber eyes peer from gnarled tree hollows,their claws scraping against petrified wood. thin rivulets of blood trickle down her ankles where barbed tendrils pierce the skin,droplets crystallizing upon touching the ashen ground. a low-hanging mist swirls with fragmented whispers,distorting the girl's silhouette into wavering afterimages under dim blue-green light.",
