          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a girl in the a dimly lit underground chamber,surrounded by glowing blue runes etched into ancient stone pillars. thick green liquid drips from cracked incubation pods lining the walls,while translucent eggs float in viscous fluid nearby. flickering torchlight casts elongated shadows resembling tentacles across moss-covered walls. her feet sink slightly into the damp stone floor littered with broken chains and shattered cultist masks. behind her,a massive circular incubation pool bubbles with bioluminescent organisms,emitting faint whispers of forbidden chants. the air shimmers with particles of ancient dust illuminated by floating energy spheres.",
