        {
          "id": "docx-n45-2faaef80988e554ab615af75",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the composition centers on a detailed figurine of a young girl,viewed in profile from the left foreground. she wears a simple white t-shirt adorned with a pink graphic design. her gaze is directed intently towards the right,her hands hovering near the surface of a brightly illuminated glass display case,conveying a sense of curiosity or admiration.occupying the right side of the frame,inside the display case,stands a prominent,intricately designed mecha or robot figurine. this imposing figure features a complex grey and silver armored exoskeleton with accents of red plating,particularly visible on the chest and joints. its design incorporates sharp angles,multiple layers of armor,and articulated limbs,culminating in a helmeted head with pointed crests and glowing orange optical sensors or eyes. the robot is posed dynamically,facing slightly towards the viewer and the girl figurine.the display case housing the robot is brightly lit from above by cool,blue-white light strips,which cast strong highlights and deep shadows across the robot's metallic surfaces,emphasizing its form and texture. visible reflections shimmer on the glass barrier separating the girl from the displayed items. behind the primary robot figure,numerous other smaller anime girl figurines are arranged on shelves within the same case,adding depth and context to the display.in the background,beyond the girl figurine and partially obscured by a shallow depth of field,are shelves densely packed with various forms of merchandise,likely anime figures,dvds,or other collectibles,rendered in warmer tones. this background is softly blurred,employing a bokeh effect that draws focus to the foreground interaction between the girl figurine and the robot display,creating a scene reminiscent of a collector's room or a specialty hobby shop.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_42948_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
