          "id": "docx-n45-8479de0bdce4958c9abb1684",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the scene is depicted with bright,even illumination consistent with a retail environment. the image portrays an aisle within what appears to be a hobby or model kit store,densely stocked with merchandise. white metal shelving units line the walls,filled neatly with numerous packaged model kits. the boxes predominantly feature artwork of futuristic mecha,spaceships,and particularly female characters integrated with cybernetic or mechanical components,rendered in a similar anime aesthetic. many boxes share a color scheme involving shades of pink,white,and grey,suggesting a specific product line or theme.dominating the central background is a large,eye-catching vertical display or poster showcasing a detailed illustration of a female character. this character embodies a blend of human and machine,clad in minimal,form-fitting cybernetic armor that reveals significant portions of her physique while incorporating complex mechanical elements,including large weapon attachments and propulsion units extending from her back and arms. she has long,dark hair and large,expressive eyes typical of the genre,gazing towards the viewer.in the foreground and midground,shoppers interact with the environment. on the right,a young boy and a slightly younger girl,presumably siblings,are shown from the back and side respectively. the boy stands observing the shelves,while the girl reaches towards a stack of model kit boxes placed on the floor,seemingly examining them. both are dressed casually. partially visible in the extreme foreground is the head and shoulders of another young girl with similar hair color to the central character,adding depth to the scene but obscuring the lower portion of the view. the overall composition emphasizes the abundance of specialized merchandise and the consumer environment associated with anime and mecha model kits.",
          "description": "",
