          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "in a high-fantasy,futuristic art style reminiscent of modern video game concept art,the scene features numerous holographic user interface elements displaying in-game statistics and data. at the center,a woman with blue eyes,cloaked in a dark hood,conjures a glowing,shimmering orb of light as if beginning a magical incantation. behind her stands a shadowy,armored figure,a sheathed sword at their side,acting as a guardian. floating screens surround the pair,filled with detailed readouts and character statistics written in an indecipherable,ancient script,suggesting the rules of an intricate card game. the color palette emphasizes deep purples,blues,and blacks in the shadows,sharply contrasted by the intense,electric greens,yellows,and lighter blues emanating from the light orb and outlining the forms,consistent with a digital painting aesthetic featuring vibrant neon accents.",
