        {
          "id": "docx-n45-c96047486e17437e2655ebf4",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the composition is centered around three female characters rendered in an anime aesthetic. the central figure,positioned prominently against a large,luminous white circular backdrop suggestive of a full moon,gazes directly forward with an enigmatic expression. she possesses long,flowing blue hair that cascades over her shoulders and wears attire that hints at a fantasy or mystical setting,with discernible details in her clothing despite the pixelated rendering. flanking her are two other female characters,contributing to a balanced triangular arrangement. the character on the left,featuring shorter,tousled reddish-pink hair,is depicted from a three-quarter back view,her head turned slightly as if looking towards or past the central figure. the character on the right,distinguished by long,flowing pink hair and a noticeable antenna-like ahoge,is presented in profile,gazing towards the central character,her features clearly defined against the dark background.",
          "description": "",
