        {
          "id": "docx-n45-c2159282bad8c870d3090e0e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "at the bottom of the frame,three distinct rectangular buttons,characteristic of a video game's main menu interface,are aligned horizontally. these buttons are rendered with a pixelated bevel effect,giving them a slightly three-dimensional appearance. each button features capitalized english text in a bold,sans-serif pixel font. the leftmost button reads \"start.\" the central button displays \"jrpg,\" with the smaller subtext \"continue\" positioned directly beneath it. the rightmost button is labeled \"exit.\" the overall visual presentation strongly suggests a title screen for a japanese role-playing game (jrpg),skillfully evoking a sense of mystery,adventure,and nostalgia through its thematic elements,character designs,and dedicated retro pixel art execution.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_42959_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
