        {
          "id": "docx-n45-0efe3d125b77c6df4a36b29f",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "presented as a technical blueprint on gridded paper,the central subject is a heavily armed,bipedal combat mech shown in a three-quarter perspective,angled slightly towards the viewer's left. the machine possesses a robust and utilitarian design,constructed from angular plates,exposed joints,and numerous mechanical components. its posture is stable,supported by powerful,reverse-jointed legs terminating in large,flat feet designed for traction and weight distribution. intricate details such as pistons,actuators,and segmented armor are visible on the limbs. the main chassis,or torso,is boxy and substantial,likely housing the primary systems and cockpit,indicated by a sloped front section with small sensor arrays or viewports. prominently mounted weaponry includes two large cannons extending backwards over the shoulders and a multi-barrel rotary cannon affixed to the front-left aspect of the torso. the illustration employs heavy black ink for shading,utilizing both solid fills and dense cross-hatching to convey form,depth,and the metallic nature of the mech's surfaces. surrounding the mech are various elements typical of a schematic diagram,including text boxes,leader lines pointing to specific components (labeled with placeholder text like \"power system,\" \"weapon system,\" \"control system\"),inset diagrams showing alternate views or details in the lower-left corner,and title blocks in the upper-left and lower-right corners. a distinctive solid blue shadow is cast by the mech onto the grid background,indicating a directional light source from the upper left and adding a layer of dimensionality to the otherwise flat presentation format.",
          "description": "",
