        {
          "id": "docx-n45-fc09da618b912e4e82518be9",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "presented as a technical blueprint on gridded paper,the central subject is a banshee gundam shown in a three-quarter perspective,angled slightly towards the viewer's left. the illustration employs heavy black ink for shading,utilizing both solid fills and dense cross-hatching to convey form,depth,and the metallic nature of the mech's surfaces. surrounding the mech are various elements typical of a schematic diagram,including text boxes,leader lines pointing to specific components (labeled with placeholder text like \"power system,\" \"weapon system,\" \"control system\"),inset diagrams showing alternate views or details in the lower-left corner,and title blocks in the upper-left and lower-right corners.",
          "description": "",
