          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "looking at viewer,smile,hand up,nail polish,fingernails,sketch,tattoo,dutch angle,glowing,black background,portrait,cross,fire,black nails,veil,glowing eyes,blue nails,spot color,high collar,blue theme,long bangs,nun,habit,limited palette,glowing eye,blue fire,barcode,flaming eye,light trail,traditional nun,barcode tattoo,eye trail,this digital drawing features a close-up of a young girl,emitting a faint blue glow from her left eye. she has a pale complexion and is dressed in a white and grey outfit,with black accents. the background is stark black with splashes of blue,creating a dramatic and intense atmosphere. the girl's hand is raised,palm open,fingers splayed,as if casting a spell. the lighting is artificial,with the blue glow intensifying the scene. the style is reminiscent of anime with sharp lines and high contrast. the image is angled slightly from below,emphasizing the mysterious and powerful aura of the character",
