        {
          "id": "docx-n45-d89be5e367886068d1aadcf9",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the image captures a young woman,presumably a musician,in an engaged moment of performance. she is the central figure,presented in a medium close-up shot,angled slightly to the viewer's left. her head is tilted downwards,her gaze directed towards the instrument she is playing or slightly away from the microphone. dark,wavy,shoulder-length hair frames her face,emerging from beneath a black,peaked military-style cap which features a gold-colored circular emblem,possibly a wreath or insignia,on its front. her facial features are distinct,with a pale complexion providing a contrast to her dark hair and the vibrant red lipstick applied to her full lips. she appears to be singing or have just finished a vocal line,as her lips are slightly parted near a black,professional-grade microphone mounted on a stand positioned directly before her.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_42971_自然语言.jpg",
