        {
          "id": "docx-n45-0b1f0d533791fad7f1b53d90",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "her attire consists of a dark navy or black zip-up jacket,which is worn partially unzipped and draped off her left shoulder. this reveals a significant portion of her left arm and shoulder,as well as a white or light-colored v-neck top underneath. the open v-neck of the top and the way the jacket is worn expose a considerable area of her upper chest and cleavage. an in-ear monitor is visible in her left ear,indicative of a professional musical performance setting. clipped to her jacket,near her left armpit,is a small,dark rectangular electronic device,likely a wireless transmitter pack for her instrument or microphone.",
