        {
          "id": "docx-n45-958e59d080dfcb3359fd18e4",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "she is actively playing a reddish-brown electric bass guitar,identified by its four thick strings and the visible headstock with tuning pegs. her right hand is captured fretting the strings on the neck of the guitar. a patterned guitar strap,predominantly green with intricate lighter-colored details,runs over her right shoulder and diagonally across her chest,supporting the instrument. the background of the photograph is softly blurred,creating a bokeh effect,which emphasizes the subject. this out-of-focus backdrop consists of diffuse shapes in pale pink and blue hues,with larger,bright circular forms in the upper left quadrant that suggest out-of-focus stage lights or other elements of a performance venue. the overall impression is one of concentration and artistic expression within a live music environment.",
          "description": "",
