          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a soft-spoken girl in a loose cardigan sits by the window of a quiet backstreet café,golden sunlight filtering through the lace curtains,casting delicate patterns on the wooden table,ceramic mug in hand still steaming gently,the hum of conversation blending with the distant chime of a tram bell,light dust dancing in the rays like slow-moving snow,trailing ivy outside gently swaying with the breeze,glass bottles on the windowsill glowing amber in the light,warm tones of cream,maple,and faded blue form a nostalgic color palette,asymmetrical framing with an off-center teacup and a half-eaten croissant,background blurred into softness with subtle textures of worn wood and chalkboard menus,a tabby cat curled beneath a sunlit chair,the faint sound of a record player spinning an old jazz tune,a moment suspended in stillness and light,evoking themes of simplicity,comfort,and the quiet rhythm of everyday life.",
