        {
          "id": "docx-n45-7d34f4849e424c2f9f35b723",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this is a digital painting in a highly expressionist style,filled with a chaotic and violent energy. a vague human figure occupies the center of the frame. its facial features are rendered unrecognizable by rough,powerful brushstrokes and splattered colors,making it seem as if it's undergoing a violent disintegration or letting out a scream. the color palette is dominated by deep blacks,fiery reds,and stark yellows. these high-contrast colors collide and merge,creating a visual effect reminiscent of burning or an explosion. the brushwork is wild and unconventional,featuring a mix of heavy textures,sharp scratching marks,and splattered spots. these chaotic textures combine to construct the figure's inner turmoil,be it pain,rage,or ecstasy. light seems to burst forth from within the figure itself,especially in the facial area,where highlights of red and yellow resemble burning embers,creating a stark contrast with the surrounding darkness. the overall atmosphere of the painting is dark,surreal,and charged with a raw,unrestrained emotional power.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43008_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
