          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this is a highly expressionistic digital painting,filled with chaotic and violent energy,focusing on a monstrous female figure. her form emerges from the darkness in coarse,powerful brushstrokes and splattered colors,blurring the boundary between her body and the background. beneath her signature white hair and glasses,a massive mouth full of sharp teeth is torn open amidst wild textures,appearing as an incarnation of pure rage and appetite. in this black-and-white chaos,two points of fiery red light in her eyes become the only color,glowing like burning embers and filled with irrepressible malice and madness.",
