        {
          "id": "docx-n45-c8846034c12d461a59e13f85",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the city sprawls beneath her like a circuit board come alive—neon arteries pulse with data streams,holographic billboards flicker in smog-choked air,and skyscrapers claw at a starless sky. she stands atop a gargoyle-like drone docking station,her silhouette sharp against the cyan haze of the cyberpunk metropolis. clad in mechanical combat armor,the suit's angular plates glow faintly at the seams,energy overflow bleeding through cracks in the alloy—a volatile reminder of systems pushed to their limits.",
