          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "her neon-lit headband hums with a cold,cerulean radiance,casting jagged shadows across her face. mechanical detachment hardens her features; eyes like polished steel lock onto a target far below,pupils flickering with targeting subroutines. one knee braces against the ledge,her body coiled in a sniper's crouch,a sleek,rail-thin plasma rifle gripped in gloved hands. the weapon's barrel steadies as she aims downward,crosshairs overlaying a swarm of security drones ascending toward her perch.",
