        {
          "id": "docx-n45-9a19939270beb3bd8c1f969b",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this is a female robot in the assembly or awakening stage. her body has an elegant and slender silhouette,but most of her body still exposes the internal precise mechanical skeleton and servo systems. her upper body is covered with some smooth,white ceramic - like shells,but there are obvious seams and unclosed buckles between the shells,indicating her unfinished state. from her exposed spine and neck,countless black and gray cables of different thicknesses extend. these cables hang down like a waterfall. some are connected to a huge,unknown server or life - support system behind her,while others twine around her waist and limbs like vines. the interfaces at the ends are suspended in the air,waiting to be connected to the modules in the next stage. her head is already formed,with a delicate and expressionless face and eyes closed. however,the back half of her head is open,and the complex circuit boards and faintly glowing fiber - optic bundles inside can be seen. these fibers also converge into a data cable,which is connected to external devices. one of her arms has a complete arm shell installed,while the other remains in the mechanical skeleton stage,with the finger joints and drive devices clearly visible. the entire scene is presented in black - and - white monochrome,with lines as precise and sharp as an architectural blueprint,full of technical details. the light shines intensively from one direction,creating a strong contrast between the highlighted shells and the matte mechanical skeletons,highlighting the cold mechanical texture and the beauty of the structure,and creating an atmosphere that is both grand and full of mystery. she is both a precise industrial creation and an \"eve\" about to be given life,quietly suspended in the complex mechanical and data flow.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43025_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-15T19:15:48.427756",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-15T19:15:48.427756",
