        {
          "id": "docx-n45-7faefa48caf625dc2763af4d",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "solo,looking at viewer,1boy,standing,signature,hood,sword,holding weapon,cape,armor,from side,mask,glowing,holding sword,helmet,black background,katana,sheath,cloak,glowing eyes,black cape,scabbard,this is a digital illustration in a painterly fantasy style,characterized by a cool and dark color palette dominated by blues,teals,and deep violets,and featuring visible,somewhat gestural brushstrokes.the scene employs dramatic,low-key lighting within a dark theme,characterized by strong highlights contrasting with deep shadows,and certain elements exhibiting a glow in the dark effect.the artwork portrays a formidable,ethereal figure standing against a profoundly dark and indistinct background,this central entity,appearing as a humanoid warrior or mystical being,is encased in elaborate armor that seems almost organic or crystalline,featuring intricate,swirling patterns rendered in shades of deep blue,teal,violet,and subtle hints of crimson,all punctuated by luminous cyan highlights,the figure dons an ornate helmet or possesses a head structure crowned with formations resembling stylized,icy antlers or sharp crystalline shards,from which two bright cyan eyes glow intensely,piercing the surrounding darkness,a dark,flowing cloak or mantle drapes over the shoulders and billows outwards,rendered with dynamic,broad brushstrokes that convey movement and volume,swirling tendrils composed of blue energy,ethereal matter,or perhaps stylized water curl dynamically around the upper body and head,suggesting contained power and adding a sense of fluid motion to the composition; small,floating,glowing orbs are subtly interspersed within these energy trails,in its right hand,the figure grips the hilt of a sword,its design echoing the aesthetic of the armor with sharp angles and glowing blue accents,though much of the blade extends out of view or dissolves into the shadows,the overall composition is focused and powerful,leveraging the stark contrast between the selectively illuminated figure and the deep environmental shadows to create a commanding sense of mystery,coldness,and formidable presence.",
          "description": "",
