          "prompt": "a young man with spiky dark hair and a somber expression stands in a futuristic city at dusk. he is shown from the waist up,in three-quarters profile,looking down and to his left. he wears a tattered,high-collared black coat that appears weathered and shredded,billowing around him. on his right hand is a black fingerless glove,and this hand rests on the hilt of a katana-style sword. the blade of the sword is not traditional metal but is composed of brilliant,crackling purple energy,akin to lightning,which casts a strong magenta glow on his clothes,arm,and the ground. he is set against a sprawling cityscape of towering,dark skyscrapers with glowing windows in shades of blue,orange,and purple. in the upper right background,a bright blue neon sign on a building reads \"nexus-09\". the sky is a deep,dark blue,streaked with wispy reddish-pink clouds. the ground appears wet,reflecting the neon lights of the city. the composition is shot from a slightly low angle,with a shallow depth of field that keeps the man and his sword in sharp focus while the cityscape behind him is softly blurred.",
