        {
          "id": "docx-n45-b1aa8d441384b814371ebc92",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "white veil 2::cowboy shot::,covered breasts,3::sagging breasts::,2::,white hanfu,sitting on a big lotus,palm to palm::,shawl,hagoromo,a divine goddess sits gracefully in a meditative lotus position,her palms gently pressed together in a prayerful mudra. she radiates a serene yet alluring aura,combining sacred elegance with captivating beauty. her flawless skin glows softly like moonlight,and her long flowing hair cascades around her shoulders like dark silk. she wears translucent silken robes in shades of pearl white and rose gold,revealing the elegant contours of her body without vulgarity—balanced perfectly between divinity and sensuality. delicate golden ornaments and lotus-shaped jewelry adorn her wrists,neck,and forehead,shimmering with sacred light.behind her,a massive glowing halo of golden lotus petals and sanskrit-like sigils pulses with ethereal energy. she floats above a calm,misty pond covered in blooming lotuses,with divine light and warm incense smoke swirling around her form. her expression is calm and knowing—benevolent,yet with an air of mysterious allure. she is both mother of compassion and embodiment of beauty,a goddess who inspires devotion,awe,and desire in equal measure.1.5::hairpin,spread knees,crossed foot,half close eyes,1.5::pale skin,shiny skin,::,reme,forehead mark,flower mark,mole under mouth,from below,2::skindentation",
          "description": "",
