          "id": "docx-n45-79bd98587b5b52568957377e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "viewed from a low angle,the image captures a formidable female warrior in a dynamic combat stance. she is clad in sophisticated white and gold mecha-style armor that gleams under the intense light,its design blending futuristic technology with ancient egyptian motifs. her elaborate headdress,reminiscent of a pharaoh,features stylized wings and a central insignia,complemented by modern,headphone-like components over her ears. the character has short,dark hair and her focused gaze is directed forward,her magenta eyes shining with determination. she wields a sword with a golden hilt,its blade composed of translucent,glowing cyan energy. surrounding her are abstract and technological elements,including fragmented digital artifacts,glitch effects,and a floating,holographic ring of light inscribed with indecipherable glowing characters,reinforcing the cybernetic and almost divine aura of the subject.",
