        {
          "id": "docx-n45-145e0638da41bd0f5d70902e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "full body,from side,looking away,{{wide shot,landscape}},cinematic angle,aerial,trapped within the infinite recursion of a klein bottle mindscape,a girl curls around the topological singularity where her heart should be. her neural dendrites extend as glowing riemann surfaces,each memory fragment sliced into non-euclidean shards tumbling endlessly down penrose staircases. when cartesian axes shatter into klein-blue vines piercing her visual cortex,the invasion triggers surreal hallucinations - burning sierpiński carpets consuming logic centers,fractal ferns erupting from pituitary glands to rewire cognition into endless gödel loops. the oozing walls drip klein-bottled paradox honey that splashes into mathematical abyss,each drop crystallizing into cantor dust clouds containing all possible methods of intellectual annihilation",
          "description": "",
