          "prompt": "black jacket,sailor collar,white shirt,choker,hair ribbon,red ribbon,silver ring,black chokerseductive,alluring,smug,looking at viewer,open mouth,teasing,pensive,calmpulling red string,string connected to eye,tying hair,holding ribbon,delicate finger movements,touching facewhite background,red border,two panel comic stripclean lineart,painterly shading,dramatic shadows,cast shadow,sharp focus,high contrastclose up,portrait,upper body,from side,profilemonochrome,black theme,red theme,limited palettea two-panel comic layout portrays a girl with striking red eyes and long black hair. in the top panel,a close-up shows her looking directly at the viewer with a seductive,smug expression,her mouth slightly open revealing small fangs. she playfully pulls a thin red string that seems to emerge from the corner of her eye. the bottom panel shifts to a side profile view,where she is calmly tying the same red ribbon into her hair,her expression now more pensive. the entire piece is framed with a red border against a clean white background,creating a stylish and focused narrative.",
