        {
          "id": "docx-n45-32bcb3501d64149033cb7aec",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "award winning photography,double exposure,multiple exposure,silhouette,black and white with partial color,1girl,profile silhouette,a sprawling city view of tokyo at night,rain-streaked train window,shinjuku,glowing neon signs,light trails from traffic,reflections on wet asphalt,the girl's silhouette is filled with the city lights,her outline is sharp against a simple dark background,her hair seems to merge with the rain streaks,emotional,nostalgic,lonely,serene,strong artistic composition,asymmetrical,rule of thirds,film grain,light leak,signature,ozanculha (style),surrealism,high contrast,bokeh,bright colors (in city part),monochromatic (in silhouette part),blue theme,purple theme,a double exposure portrait where the silhouette of a girl looking out a window is perfectly blended with a breathtaking,rain-slicked panorama of nighttime tokyo. the vibrant neon lights of the city fill her form,creating a stark contrast with the dark,minimalist background. the boundary between the girl and the cityscape is blurred,as if she is made of memories and light. the composition places her silhouette on the right,leaving negative space that enhances the feeling of introspection and urban solitude.",
