        {
          "id": "docx-n45-23038b4164b32fff85e89e93",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,scarf,cape,armor,the scene utilizes dramatic,moody lighting characterized by a dark theme where vibrant elements provide strong,glow-in-the-dark illumination,creating high contrast. a young woman with long hair,tinged with blue and purple highlights from the ambient neon light,crouches low,gazing directly forward with large,eyes. her pose is grounded and assertive,one hand placed firmly on the surface before her,which is itself marked by splashes of vivid magenta energy. dominating the space behind her is a colossal monster. this spectral figure appears composed of pure energy that swirls and splashes dynamically against the deep black void of the background. its mouth is wide open in a fierce roar,revealing sharp,glowing fangs in a potent display of untamed power. in the immediate foreground,beneath the woman,bold,jagged graffiti-style lettering rendered in acidic green proclaims a fragmented word,possibly \"code vein,\" contributing to the overall urban,high-energy feel. the composition skillfully blends detailed character illustration with abstract energy forms and graphic text elements,creating a visually striking narrative steeped in neon-drenched atmosphere and futuristic style.",
