        {
          "id": "docx-n45-4e5b0bad357fa023ac94ebcd",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "solo,outdoors,day,signature,hood,from behind,tree,no humans,building,1other,scenery,snow,architecture,winter,east asian architecture,bare tree,castle,ambiguous gender,tower,fog,very wide shot,pagoda,temple,this is a digital illustration in a painterly realism style,dominated by a cool,desaturated palette of blues,grays,and whites,with subtle warmer earth tones on the structures,featuring visible,textured brushstrokes that blend forms and contribute to the atmospheric rendering.the scene is characterized by soft lighting and weak light,diffused by heavy fog,creating a moody atmosphere.the composition depicts a vast,snow-covered landscape shrouded in dense fog. in the lower center-right foreground,a solitary figure,diminutive against the imposing backdrop,stands cloaked and facing towards a complex of traditional east asian architectural structures. the foreground consists of uneven,dark,snow-dusted ground,with bare,skeletal branches reaching into the frame from the lower left,enhancing the desolate feel. occupying the midground are substantial buildings,including a wide,multi-tiered temple-like structure on the left and a tall,imposing pagoda piercing the fog on the right,both heavily laden with snow and exhibiting signs of significant weathering or perhaps neglect. thin cables or wires are faintly discernible,strung between these primary structures. the pervasive fog is a dominant element,enveloping the bases of the buildings and progressively obscuring architectural details with distance,contributing significantly to the strong sense of atmospheric perspective. further indistinct shapes,suggesting more distant traditional structures and potentially even the faint silhouettes of modern skyscrapers,loom ethereally in the deep background,almost entirely consumed by the thick mist. the overall mood conveyed is one of profound solitude,piercing coldness,and quiet mystery,set within a desolate yet visually striking environment that evokes a sense of forgotten grandeur or a post-event stillness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43112_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
