        {
          "id": "docx-n45-659017efc54da3c48989608a",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a girl,drenched in blood and clothed in torn remnants,stands amidst a crumbling ruin,gazing directly at the viewer with an emotionless expression. her eyes glow with an intense,piercing red light that cuts through the dust-filled air like twin embers in the dark.the entire scene is awash in shades of red—deep,shadowed crimsons blending with sharp scarlet highlights. the ruined surroundings are littered with shattered concrete,twisted metal,and scorched fragments of once-standing structures. faint trails of smoke curl up from the wreckage,tinted red by a flickering light source offscreen. sparks crackle faintly in the distance,and glowing cracks in the earth hint at a violent power still simmering beneath the surface. the atmosphere is suffocating—silent,yet thrumming with restrained chaos,as though the world has paused in awe or fear of her presence. every element of the scene builds toward a climax not yet seen,steeped in dramatic stillness and looming dread.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43113_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
