        {
          "id": "docx-n45-706b344a02ca0f14749399a3",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "{{1girl}},the image depicts a fantastical,mythical creature with a dragon-like appearance. it has a dark,muscular body adorned with intricate,swirling patterns that resemble armor or scales. the creature's head is adorned with a mane of flowing,vibrant blue and purple flames,giving it a dynamic and powerful presence. its eyes are narrowed,and it appears to be in a commanding stance,with one hand raised and glowing with fiery energy. the background is a swirling vortex of colors,predominantly blue and orange,with celestial elements like stars and planets,suggesting a cosmic or otherworldly setting. the overall style is highly stylized and vibrant,with a strong emphasis on contrast and movement.no text",
          "description": "",
