          "prompt": "1girl,solo,extreme ito junji horror manga style,pure black and white high-contrast ink with dense hatching and screentone,sanity-shattering spiral-eyed girl in tattered school uniform,mouth unnaturally stretched into impossible widening scream revealing endless rows of spiraling teeth,long black hair morphing into writhing tendrils that pierce through her own skull and coil into fractal voids,body contorted in grotesque impossible angles with joints bending backward,skin covered in crawling obsessive spiral patterns and gaping eye-covered sores,background collapsing into infinite spiraling abyss of screaming faces and fragmented reality,heavy ink splatter and distortion waves,broken panel borders bleeding into each other,obsessive detailed linework with microscopic horror elements,complete mental collapse and cosmic dread atmosphere,drop in sanity,pure terror",
