        {
          "id": "docx-n45-9ec4a63f8cd48137cb11da9d",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,absolute peak ito junji black-and-white nightmare,zero grey,only pure ink and void,girl's face split vertically into perfect left-right mirror yet each half devours the other in endless spiral of teeth biting teeth,eyes replaced by bottomless spiraling holes that suck in the panel borders themselves,tongue elongating into a barbed drill piercing through her own forehead and exiting the back of the skull still spinning,hair transformed into thousands of segmented centipede legs crawling out of scalp and burrowing back in,neck twisted 540 degrees with vertebrae visibly popping through skin in perfect screentone dots,arms elongated to impossible length wrapping around torso seven times while fingers melt into dripping ink that forms new screaming mouths on her ribs,uniform shredded into razor-sharp paper strips slicing her own flesh yet blood drawn as obsessive cross-hatching that forms smaller copies of her screaming face,background no longer exists,only infinite recursive spiral panels showing the same girl getting progressively more broken and fused with the page,gutters bleeding black ichor,speech bubbles filled with unreadable spiraling calligraphy that makes viewer's eyes bleed,every line hand-drawn with murderous precision,maximum possible detail density,sanity instantaneous zero,pure distilled cosmic body horror terror that cannot be unseen",
          "description": "",
