          "prompt": "1girl,solo,miniature size,sitting on the rim of a tall,slender cocktail glass with a delicate stem and a crystal-clear,frosty surface,viewed from a side angle that captures her full posture against the glass,she is tilting her head back to look directly up at the camera with a playful,curious expression,her right hand holding a single,glossy red cherry poised just before her slightly parted lips as if about to take a bite,her left hand pressed firmly against the smooth,cool edge of the glass for balance,inside the glass,a vibrant,translucent blue carbonated drink fills the lower portion,packed with clear,geometric ice cubes that sparkle and refract light,a slender,striped straw leaning against the inner side of the glass,the overall scene is bright,whimsical,and dreamlike with soft,emphasizing the contrast between her tiny figure and the large glass,a sense of playful fantasy and summer vibes",
