          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the image depicts two young anime-style girls,both dressed in elaborate train conductor uniforms,interacting with a colorful,detailed toy playset on a table. the girl on the left has long black hair and dark red eyes,wearing a black and gold uniform,and holds a black miniature train. the girl on the right has short,light pink hair and golden-brown eyes,wearing a cream uniform with a red bow,and holds a red and white miniature train. both are smiling brightly as they place and move their miniature trains along the toy tracks that run through the whimsical playset,which includes miniature houses and various small dolls.",
