          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,1.5::walking slowly through a desolate battlefield littered with countless corpses::,1.5::expressionless with a hollow blank stare::,1.4::carefully wiping a blood-stained dagger with a white torn cloth while moving::,1.3::blood splashing across her cheek and tattered clothes::,1.3::one hand gripping the hilt while the other meticulously cleans the steel blade::,1.2::hair fluttering in the cold post-battle wind::,1.1::stepping over broken swords and fallen soldiers::,massacre,1.6::field of dead bodies stretching to the horizon under a heavy grey sky::,1.5::piles of tangled limbs and discarded armor in the background::,1.4::large pools of dark blood reflecting the dim light on the muddy ground::,1.3::faint smoke rising from smoldering ruins in the distance::,1.2::desaturated and gritty environment::,1.5::harsh low-key lighting with deep dramatic shadows::,1.4::cold overcast daylight creating a somber atmosphere::,1.4::strong rim lighting highlighting her silhouette against the dark carnage::,1.3::specular glints on the partially cleaned dagger blade::,1.2::volumetric fog and dust swirling around her feet::,cinematic,dark fantasy,outdoors",
