          "prompt": "1girl,1.5::huddled on a rusted and peeling metal bench::,1.4::clutching a worn leather suitcase tightly to her chest::,1.2::knuckles white from gripping her bag::,1.2::breath forming a faint cold mist in the stagnant air::,1.5::dilapidated abandoned train station platform::,1.4::cracked concrete floors with tall withered weeds growing through the fissures::,1.4::rusted railway tracks disappearing into a thick unnatural fog::,1.3::shattered glass shards littering the ground::,1.3::walls covered in layers of grime and cryptic dark stains::,1.2::broken clock frozen at an impossible hour::,1.6::sickly flickering overhead fluorescent light casting long erratic shadows::,1.5::harsh high-contrast chiaroscuro lighting::,1.4::dense eerie mist crawling along the platform edge::,1.4::deep oppressive shadows hiding distorted shapes in the background::,1.3::faint cold moonlight filtering through a jagged hole in the ceiling::,1.2::unseen eyes watching from the darkness::,horror,ominous atmosphere,dark palette,cinematic,outdoors,night",
