        {
          "id": "docx-n45-5572aaee300c77fe251981ba",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "photo background,real world location,a room with a dim,moody atmosphere is filled with many tall stacks of books and scattered open pages on the floor. a girl sits hunched over,focused on an open book in front of her. a large floor-to-ceiling window frames a view of a city skyline at night with glowing lights. most strikingly,countless luminous fish swim through the night sky like a phantom sea,glowing with soft blue,green,and aqua light,creating a dreamlike aquatic world above the city. the overall palette is dark and subdued,evoking a quiet,mysterious mood.",
          "description": "",
