        {
          "id": "docx-n45-7f88d7286c769375890d4896",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,1.6::lying amidst scattered sketchbook pages in morning light,her body fragmented into twenty-seven intimate geometric studies across the sheets,slowly rotating and hovering in space::,1.5::a transitional pose between fragmentation and wholeness,one wrist reaching through a conceptual rib structure to touch a floating icosahedron labeled \"heart\",her expression a composite of multiple mirrored emotions::,1.5::bare skin subtly imprinted with a permanent cubist grid of faint lines-a tactile memory of having been measured and drawn-as light shifts across the pages and her form::,1.4::sunlight gradually illuminates the pages and her body,causing the floating geometric studies to realign and collapse back into a coherent whole,while the heart polyhedron reflects splintered glimpses of her face from the night before::,1.3::textures of rough sketch paper,smooth skin,soft morning light,the waxy trace of lipstick annotations,and the conceptual sheen of floating forms::,1.2::background of a quiet,sunlit studio with a tousled bed and scattered drawing tools,a space suspended between analysis and intimacy::,masterpiece,anatomical tenderness,a portrait where love is expressed through the meticulous,painful,and beautiful geometry of seeing and being seen.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43161_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-15T19:15:48.427756",
