        {
          "id": "docx-n45-fb9765b9ec0039901ae4bfc8",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,1.6::fragmented within a cubist atelier,her form and crimson dance dress disassembled across a 90-degree space framed by four canvases,elements floating in three dimensions::,1.5::a dynamic pose of reassembly,her body parts displaced and reconfigured-a real hand passing through a sketched rib structure,a knee's cubic shadow transforming into an elbow's spherical form on the wall::,1.5::a red dance dress deconstructed into floating geometric fabric planes-triangles,diamonds-some attached,others hovering independently to suggest absent curves,with cobalt paint flowing over a conceptual thigh plane::,1.4::shattered mirrors reflect her neck in seven distinct perspective slices,each showing a different curvature of the same spine,while her breath condenses into hovering transparent polyhedra capturing unseen intimate angles::,1.3::textures of smooth silk,wet paint,fractured glass,skin with visible veins,and the grainy surface of stretched canvas::,1.2::background of an artist's studio with easels,scattered brushes,and studies of geometric forms,all immersed in sharp,analytical light::,masterpiece,dimensional poetry,a portrait where body,fabric,and breath are perpetually rearranged into a living theorem of form and perception.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43162_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
