        {
          "id": "docx-n45-5a765ace9a3a7a3b153c4494",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,1.6::positioned within a moonlit temple colonnade,her physical form and its painted shadow on the wall perform separate,symbolic rituals under the shifting light::,1.5::a composed,mystical pose,one hand touching the eye of horus tattoo on her collarbone while her shadow raises the feather of truth,her body still yet alive with the subtle vibration of a heartbeat against golden armor::,1.5::an ornate golden chestplate with geometric openings,the skin beneath dusted with lapis lazuli pigment,her eyelashes sprinkled with gold dust that falls and creates tiny,glyph-like marks on her chest::,1.4::moonlight moves across the scene,emphasizing the disconnect between her solid form and its symbolic shadow,with each heartbeat causing a visible tremor along the edges of the metal::,1.3::textures of cool metal,fine mineral powder,warm skin,ancient painted plaster,and the delicate fall of gold particles::,1.2::background of massive,eroded stone columns and fragments of mythological murals under a predawn starry sky::,masterpiece,dual ritual,a living body caught between the weight of ceremony and the quiet,insistent truth of its own pulse.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43163_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
