        {
          "id": "docx-n45-daa08ad44834be967f4c0507",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,1.6::standing on the edge of a city's highest rooftop,engulfed by translucent tendrils of solidified light pollution rising like viscous liquid from the urban glow below::,1.5::a pose of arrested observation,one hand holding an astronomical telescope now entangled by the creeping light-tendrils,face tilted upward with an expression of overwhelmed awe and resignation::,1.5::a silver reflective dress mirroring the chaotic light,etched sharply against the swirling orange-yellow and purple lightscape,illuminated from within by the flowing ghost-images of billboards,traffic trails,and neon shards inside the tendrils::,1.4::long exposure motion blur blends with digital glitch artifacts,making buildings waver while she remains in stark focus::,1.3::textures of liquid light,brushed metal,optical glass,and hazy smog::,1.2::background of a distorted violet night sky,where true stars are drowned out by the pulsating web of artificial light::,masterpiece,urban sublime,a portrait of cosmic longing swallowed by the city's own electric bloodstream.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43164_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
