        {
          "id": "docx-n45-adda5f8b42be8b3de4c96197",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,magical girl,1.6::standing before a shattered mirror,tendrils of solidified “reflection” leaking from its wounds—composed of fragmented images,inverted colors,and mirrored textures that distort whatever they touch::,1.5::a defensive yet mesmerized posture,one hand reaching toward her own fractured double,expression caught between horror and recognition::,1.5::her vibrant magical attire is both source and victim—its colors warped into deep cyan and teal where the mirror-tendrils replicate and corrupt,lit by the cold flicker of surveillance-style multiple exposures::,1.4::visuals are layered through broken glass prisms,infinite recursive echoes processed with vhs tape delay and magnetic ghosting::,1.3::textures of sharp glass shards,liquid mirror silver,pixelated duplicates,and analog noise::,1.2::background of a dim room filled with countless broken mirrors,each shard reflecting a distorted version of the scene::,masterpiece,ontological horror,the self devoured by its own reflection,an identity shattered into a thousand glitching echoes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43166_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
