        {
          "id": "docx-n45-3a153104f5a9d72259c4b3af",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "rhythm game concept art,grand narrative illustration,monochromatic black and white. a lone,fragile girl stands atop a floating ruin,facing a colossal,crumbling megastructure composed of interlocking gears and celestial rings that fill the entire horizon. high-tension composition with dramatic low-angle perspective to emphasize the overwhelming scale. shattered glass shards and abstract geometric prisms swirl in a violent vortex. intense chiaroscuro lighting with blinding white highlights and deep abyssal shadows. sharp,clean linework combined with expressive ink splashes and halftone patterns. the atmosphere is epic,somber,and filled with cosmic dread. in the center,the stylized title \"void\" is rendered in a sharp,glitchy font. masterpiece,ultra-detailed,cinematic framing,high contrast,dynamic motion blur,ethereal aesthetic,8k resolution.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43174_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
