          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a young girl with long white hair and blue hair accessories stands in a green field dotted with white flowers. she holds a yellow flower,extends her arm toward a large,dark-armored figure. the figure kneels before her. the armor is black,detailed with spikes and sharp horns on the helmet. tall,futuristic buildings with geometric shapes stand in the background. the sky is clear blue with scattered white clouds. the composition is centered on the interaction between the two characters: the girl on the left,the armored figure on the right. the color palette includes blue sky,yellow flower,white hair,black armor,green grass,and white flowers. the art style is digital painting,with clean lines and a contrast between organic nature and synthetic architecture.",
