          "id": "docx-n45-1f504128511fc8198f7b37b1",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a luxurious and ethereal anime-style illustration,niji 7 style,a blonde girl with delicate features lounging lazily on an ornate silver carved sofa,wearing a flowing pale gold and white frilled gown with a soft satin sash,sheer white stockings with delicate vine tattoos on her thigh. she holds a black book titled \"asuka\" in front of her face,half-hidden. the scene is surrounded by opulent details: abundant white roses with silver leaves,vintage table lamps with soft warm glow,crystal wine glasses,stacked old leather-bound books,and draped silk fabrics. the atmosphere is a blend of dark fairy tale and aristocratic luxury,with cool-toned metallic reflections and soft cinematic lighting,highlighting the translucency of skin and the luster of fabrics. intricate details of hair strands,floral textures,and ornate furniture carvings,dreamy and immersive ambiance,high detail,8k resolution,soft brush strokes,muted and elegant color palette of silver,white,pale gold,and deep charcoal",
