        {
          "id": "docx-n45-1affd1f135e3dae4b58adb57",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a striking selective-color digital anime illustration of the mischievous fox-girl,rendered primarily in monochrome and greyscale with vivid red accents. she features her signature long black twin-tails with bright red gradient tips,a bold red highlight in her bangs,and piercing red eyes looking over a pair of round wire-rimmed glasses. atop her head are huge,fluffy black animal ears with white inner tufts and red-tipped ends,accessorized with red ribbon bows and small golden bells. her massive,extremely fluffy black tail with a red gradient tip curls on the ground beside her. she is dressed in a trendy,oversized streetwear outfit consisting of a short-sleeved graphic t-shirt layered over long sleeves,baggy cargo pants,a bold red canvas belt,and casual sneakers. she is sitting casually on a tiled urban sidewalk,leaning comfortably against a large glass storefront window. her legs are relaxed,and she is playfully pulling her glasses down slightly with one hand to gaze directly at the viewer with a confident smirk that reveals her cute snaggletooth. the background features the intricate tubes of neon signs glowing behind the dark glass. the image features high-contrast dramatic lighting,a stark black-and-white environment where only the vibrant red elements—her eyes,hair gradients,ear and tail tips,ribbons,and belt—pop dramatically,creating a cool,edgy,and highly stylized urban atmosphere.",
