        {
          "id": "docx-n45-5b928934f82e3c5f1ba6086d",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "extremely detailed,melancholic atmosphere,standing,1.2::hands on chest::,hand to neck,delicate posture,1.3::gothic dress::,black dress,white collar,black ribbon collar,long sleeves,white frilled cuffs,layered skirt,1.3::dress dissolving into feathers::,1.4::falling black feathers::,floating feathers,flying feathers,dynamic floating debris,1.2::gothic architecture::,cathedral,church spire,overcast,cloudy sky,mist,fog,muted colors,desolate background,a highly detailed,melancholic illustration of a character standing gracefully against a bleak and desolate cloudy sky. she holds her hands delicately against her chest and neck in a fragile,sorrowful posture. she is dressed in an ornate black gothic dress with a white collar,a dark ribbon tied at the neck,and elegant long sleeves ending in crisp white frilled cuffs. in a surreal and magical display,the dark fabric of her dress is breaking apart and dissolving into a massive swarm of dark feathers. a dramatic flurry of falling black feathers blows dynamically around her in the wind. behind her,towering majestically through the thick mist,are the intricate spires of a grand gothic cathedral. the entire scene features a moody,desaturated color palette,evoking a strong sense of tragedy and ethereal beauty.",
