        {
          "id": "docx-n45-d358929e0688437d75b32236",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a heavily stylized,stream-of-consciousness watercolor piece where a ghostly,half-melted human profile is violently swallowed by an explosive,abstract bloom of dark crimson and black. the flower petals are not literal,but frantic,bleeding slashes of black watercolor over a suffocating indigo base,leaving rough,frayed edge lines that crawl across the canvas like spreading veins. a single,weeping eye remains visible through the chaotic ink,its form merging with the thick red pigment. highly detailed,jagged gold leaf texture is embedded deep into the core of the dark bloom,acting as a corrosive,blinding rot spreading outward into the dark blue. the composition abandons realistic form completely,relying on aggressive textures to convey an agonizing,beautiful consumption.",
