          "id": "docx-n45-f5efa42e61f90551510d8c4e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this image is rendered through a monochromatic tone,presented in a chaotic and slightly tilted,overhead perspective. it depicts three unclothed,long-haired female human figures scattered within a complex,flowing environment filled with swirling,wave-like patterns bubble-like textures. in the upper left lies the figure in the lowest dark corners supine,her face slightly turned to the right,eyes open,a ring-like structure near her left ear,her right arm bent and placed. the figure slightly to the left of center is prone or semi-concealed,her face tilted to the lower left,eyes closed,left arm bent and hand placed below her cheek. the figure on the right is completely turned away from the viewer,revealing only her head and upper back covered by long hair,while her lower body blends into the dark,wavy area. the overall image is sharply focused,with even lighting. the pale,shadowless outlines of the figures contrast sharply with the dark,tallied textures of the surrounding environment without any depth-of-field blurring effect.",
          "description": "",
