        {
          "id": "docx-n45-dee6ceef03d02c00b43065c7",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this image presents a wide horizontal frame composition,looking out through a massive structure with rough block textures. the structure consists of several huge,horizontally parallel dark brown beams,forming narrow rectangular views between them. on the edge of the beam slightly below the center of the frame,there is a tiny black silhouette of a person wearing a wide-brimmed hat,with a long object placed flat beside them,and their posture is turned away from the viewer. the right wall inside the frame structure is light yellow,illuminated by strong side light,the shadows of the beams are cast on the wall. through the gaps between the beams,distant natural landscapes can be seen: a pale blue sky and horizon in the distance,with a large expanse of white clouds below,with clouds showing dense and scattered textures. white flighty clouds are scattered on the right side and bottom of the image,obscuring some details of the building structure and creating a hazy sense of depth. light shines in from the right and front,creating heavy shadows inside the building structure,which forms a strong contrast between light and dark with the bright outdoor landscape. the entire scene is viewed from a straight angle,with uniform focus,and the shows obvious brush textures and graininess.",
          "description": "",
