        {
          "id": "docx-n45-8704d215530a6cf332add69d",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this image,set against a pure black background,presents two humanoid entities in a close-up half-body composition. the entity in the foreground on the left has extremely pale skin and long,light blue-gray hair with irregularly pointed ends. its face features large,dark brown eyes and a short,horizontally slit-like black mouth,and it wears a white sleeveless top with a black ribbon bow at the chest. to the right rear,partially obscured by the foreground entity,is a second entity. its torso,face,and long hair are covered in a deep red,irregularly intersecting net-like texture,revealing only a dark right eye. the two entities are in physical contact at opposite ends of the image: on the right,the pale left hand of the foreground entity clasps the right hand of the rear entity,which is covered in red texture; on the left,the foreground entity's right hand rests on the extended,red-textured left hand of the rear entity. all visible fingertips of both entities have a sharp,white,cone-shaped appearance. the image is taken from eye level,is sharply focused,and has no depth-of-field blurring effect. the even lighting creates a strong contrast in color and light between the red and white of the foreground and background objects and the pure black background. no traces of censorship or pixelation were found in the image.",
