        {
          "id": "docx-n45-4782f02bde59d3cef6f05272",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this image presents a flat composition made up of paper-cut or collage elements,containing two main entities. on the left side of the picture is a huge white animal skull-shaped structure in right-profile. its surface has black shadows and hatching. it has long and open upper and lower jaws,exposing square teeth. the eye socket of the skull is replaced with an image of a real human eyeball with a pink sclera and a black pupil. on the top of the head,there extends a structure with rough texture and serrated protrusions. on the right side of the picture,a female figure stands half-length. it is presented in high contrast black and white textures,wearing a black top hat,a thick coat with a rough and mottled pattern,and multiple layers of scarves around the neck. her face is covered with strong black shadows,and she has pure white eyes without pupils and a rectangular black nose. the background of the main body consists of a pure black area and a dark brown vertical wood-grain surface at the upper-right corner of the picture. the picture has no photographic depth-of-field blurring effect,and all visual elements are on the same flat focal plane.",
