        {
          "id": "docx-n45-da8f60b17cd7bbf023445748",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "this image depicts two figures engaging in close interaction against a white background,with a vertically centered medium shot composition. on the left is a tall,heavily armored knight clad in silver-gray metal armor adorned with intricate engravings,and a thick white fur collar around his shoulders. the knight wears a fully enclosed helmet with a decorative protrusion at the top that curves backward. both the armor and the fur are extensively stained with splotches of bright red blood. his body leans slightly forward,with his head bowed against the shoulder of the figure on the right,and his right hand hangs down,gripping a cross-hilted longsword covered in blood. on the right is a smaller female figure wearing a dark green hooded robe,with the hood pushed back to reveal long dark brown hair that partially covers her left eye. her skin is fair,her expression calm yet tinged with melancholy,and her gaze is directed downward. her arms are wrapped around the knight's chest and back,assuming an embracing posture. a bright red vertical line runs straight down from the center of the top of the frame,passing through the center of the knight's head and the point where the two figures meet,extending to the bottom of the frame. the edges of the image have a soft fade-out effect,with no environmental background. light is cast from the upper right,creating distinct light and shadow contrasts on the folds of the armor and robe. the overall focus is sharp,with no lens distortion,reverse style.",
