        {
          "id": "docx-n45-6faa0d532304d1cbd36a5d0e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,her teal eyes glowing with fierce red battle energy. she is captured mid-combat in a wide,aggressive stance: one hand slams down,summoning sharp red crackling energy bursts from the ground,while the other swings a large black katana with glowing red accents behind her,motion blur on the blade emphasizing blistering speed. she wears her signature dark blue rhodes island coat with teal lining,blue plaid skirt,black thigh-high stockings,and dark shoes,her hair and coat billowing dramatically with the force of her movement. the background is a vast,swirling deep space galaxy,filled with teal and purple nebulas,scattered bright stars,and wispy cosmic dust trails. floating black-and-red glowing rectangular portals blend seamlessly into the starscape,framing the character. stark contrast lighting clashes her fiery red/teal battle energy against the cool,infinite cosmic tones,with dark spiky energy effects framing the foreground. the intense,high-octane battle aosphere is amplified by bold linework and painterly texture,set against the awe-inspiring expanse of outer space.",
