        {
          "id": "docx-n45-facd7a89ad989c5af91a7450",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "illustration with complex gritty linework and muted colors. a young,curvaceous woman with an athletic,fit physique and a large-breasted body. she has a petite frame and an athletic,toned torso and legs. she is wearing large,round sunglasses with bold yellow-orange lenses,and her lips are vividly red,glossy,and open in a bold expression. she has dark,short hair with a chic cut and bangs. her clothing is a colorful,patchwork outfit made from torn sections of old newspaper and torn magazine pages,in shades of yellow,red,blue,green,and orange,creating a collage effect that creates a striking and disorienting visual experience. the artwork uses an extreme low angle shot and extreme close-up perspective,showing the image from below and very close to the face,creating a sense of intimacy,distortion and foreshortening. the face is angled slightly upwards and to the side,with the chin exposed,lips parted,revealing the tongue and teeth,which enhances the seductive,assertive pose. the background is a solid color that provides a stark contrast to the collage elements of the outfit and the colorful,patchwork fashion of the outfit. the style is a gritty,urban collage art style,evoking the texture and layered complexity of street art and urban graffiti,with bold color contrasts and fragmented textures from the collage elements of the clothing. the pose is seductive,assertive,and alluring,with a sense of forward motion and confident sexuality. the image is framed in a way that emphasizes the upper body,face,and hands interacting with the clothing,creating an intimate,provocative,and sexually charged composition. the scene is dynamic and visually intense,capturing a moment of assertive sensuality and power,4::solo::",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43223_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
