        {
          "id": "docx-n45-eb9beb3d615c408299f756cc",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a close-up,eye-level shot captures a single young anime girl nestled within a dense field of large sunflowers. the scene is enveloped in a soft,melancholic cool purple and pale yellow color atmosphere,suggesting a diffused dusk light. the girl,positioned slightly to the right of the center,has short,messy pale pinkish-white hair and reflective,pale lavender eyes that look forward with a solemn,vacant expression. she is partially obscured by a large sunflower on the right,which she gently touches with her raised right hand,while her left hand is visible below it with fingers softly spread. the composition features a strong sense of depth,with a blurred sunflower dominating the left foreground,the girl in the midground,and a dense wall of softer,out-of-focus sunflowers filling the background.",
          "description": "",
