          "prompt": "a cinematic wide-angle distant shot on a grassy hillside under a clear blue sky. the first character is a mature girl pouncing down from the sky midair with a huge,joyful smile;fluttering dynamically in the wind as she falls. on the ground below,the second character is a mature girl.she is standing firmly on the grass,looking up at the girl with his arms spread wide open in a fully welcoming gesture,actively preparing to catch her securely in her embrace.",
