        {
          "id": "docx-n45-247cba08dfcb741bbc4c99bb",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "The scene depicts Hatsune Miku as the printed artwork on a compact disc enclosed in a clear plastic CD jewel case. The figure of Hatsune Miku printed on the disc surface, whose long, angular twin-tailed dark teal hair is interspersed with digital glitch artifacts that fragment its edges with streaks of bright blue, purple and cyan, wears her signature futuristic form-fitting outfit constructed of sharp segmented dark and light fabric panels, and is posed in side profile facing toward the left of the frame with loose strands of her hair fanning out as if moved by a light breeze, with parts of her torso and lower form broken up by fragmented glitch patterns that blend into the reflective iridescent surface of the CD. The entire jewel case is set against a smooth pale blue gradient background that lightens to an off-white shade directly behind the center of the disc, the shot is a straight-on eye-level full view of the front face of the closed jewel case, even cool-toned ambient light creates subtle refractions and rainbow iridescent highlights across the raised edges of the clear plastic case and the shiny CD surface, multiple text elements are present in the image: a matte light gray rectangular sticker affixed to the left side of the jewel case reads \"17 HATSUNE MIKU\", a transparent overlay on the right half of the disc displays the text \"01\", a globe icon, the phrase \"HIGH QUALITY SOUNDS\", followed by several lines of Python code referencing the import of the pygame module, loading an audio file named \"MIKU THANK YOU.mp3\", playing the file, and printing the string \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY\", while lines of binary code",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43233_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-15T19:15:48.427756",
