          "prompt": "a soft,surreal anime-style illustration from a first-person perspective shows a pair of oversized pale hands gently cupped together,holding a small girl in their palms. the hands are solid and softly colored,with a light whitish skin tone,subtle pink warmth,and faint cool blue shading along the contours. a small glimpse of white sleeve cuffs is visible at the wrists. the girl is small enough to lie completely within the space of the two hands,with her whole body resting securely inside their range.",
