        {
          "id": "docx-n45-7cad97f9e039a30f3baba3a0",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the girl lies on her side in a curled,sleeping-like pose. her knees are drawn up toward her body,her torso folds inward slightly,and both arms are bent close to her chest. her head tilts gently to one side,and her eyes are closed,giving her a quiet,fragile,and withdrawn presence. she has long pale blonde hair flowing around her in ribbon-like twin tails,and she wears a delicate floral headdress decorated with roses,lace,and feather-like ornaments. her outfit is an elaborate green,white,and black frilled dress with layered ruffles,floral decorations,and ribbon details,preserving a refined doll-like elegance. she wears white thigh-high stockings,and her feet are covered only by the white stockings.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43239_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
