        {
          "id": "docx-n45-08559f6b8d91f8d8fb091bf0",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the composition is close and intimate,with the hands filling most of the frame and the girl placed securely at the center. thin red threads stretch across the image and loop around several fingers. one red thread is tied to the little finger of the girl lying in the hands,and it connects continuously with the other red threads,giving the image the feeling of a red string of e. the overall color palette is soft,pale,and low-saturation,dominated by white,light gray,faint pink skin tones,and cool pale blue shadows. these muted tones are gently contrasted by the green and black accents of the girl's dress,her pale golden hair,and the vivid red threads,creating a dreamlike,delicate,and slightly unsettling atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43240_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
