        {
          "id": "docx-n45-fb2f8ade62ce4fcb31f804ea",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a surreal and artistic illustration featuring a girl standing inside a large,ornate,gold-framed mirror that is placed in the middle of a vast field of vibrant red poppies. the girl has long,straight light blonde hair and gentle,soft-focused eyes,wearing a simple white long-sleeved top and a muted blue-grey skirt,with a dark messenger bag slung over her shoulder. inside the mirror frame,the background is an interior gallery wall with two smaller framed pictures hanging on it. outside the mirror,the landscape is a moody,overcast field under a sky filled with dramatic grey clouds and rolling distant mountains. the overall lighting is soft and diffused,characteristic of an overcast day. the art style is painterly,with delicate textures and a warm-to-cool color contrast between the red flowers and the muted grey landscape.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43241_自然语言.jpg",
