        {
          "id": "docx-n45-a529b8dab35679977bed00e7",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a dramatic,surreal anime-style illustration set in a vast black space. on the far right,akemi homura kneels on the reflective ground,facing left toward a dense floating mass of figures. she is shown in profile,with long straight hair and a school-uniform-like outfit,holding one hand forward as if reaching toward or confronting the glowing center in front of her. behind and around her,a series of bright concentric circles radiates outward like a tunnel or a time distortion,drawing the eye toward a small brilliant point of light near the center-right.",
