        {
          "id": "docx-n45-939b1d929724a66641e72e93",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "on the left and center-left,kaname madoka appears as a large clustered formation of many overlapping versions of herself,suspended in midair. the figures are layered together in a chaotic yet flowing arrangement,surrounded by countless thin curved lines that loop and cross through the dark space. some versions of kaname madoka are softly illuminated in warm pale gold and cream,while others are reduced to darker blue-black silhouettes,creating a sense of repetition,memory,and accumulation. the mass seems to surge toward the light,as if pulled through time or space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43243_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
