        {
          "id": "docx-n45-047cf9244ae0089471578d35",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the overall color palette is dark,low-key,and highly cinematic,dominated by black,deep blue-gray,pale gold,cream,and muted orange light. the brightest areas gather around kaname madoka and the circular light structure behind akemi homura,while the surrounding darkness makes the glowing figures and white lines stand out sharply. the reflective floor adds a faint mirrored shimmer below the characters. the image feels lonely,cosmic,and emotionally intense,with the contrast between darkness and warm light creating a powerful sense of obsession,distance,and longing.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43244_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
