        {
          "id": "docx-n45-9bd330f28a2104b072508d6a",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the central figure is an agile black cat sliding down a curved,diagonal ink path. the cat is captured mid-movement,leaning forward with its front paws landing gracefully on the path. its body is rendered in solid,rich black with smooth,glossy reflections. bright white highlights run along the curve of its back and shoulders,defining its muscular,fluid shape. the cat’s head is in profile,facing right,featuring a sharp,alert ear and a stylized,solid white eye that stands out against its dark fur.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43260_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
