        {
          "id": "docx-n45-8a599d698852f77716c157b2",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the cat's tail is the most dramatic element of the piece; it extends upwards and twists in a sweeping arc,morphing into a large,fluid splash of wet black ink. the ink trail starts thick and solid near the body,then splinters into multiple fine,flowing calligraphic lines,dry-brush textures,and flying ink droplets that scatter across the white canvas. the top-right corner of the image is dominated by the heavy,expressive end of this ink stroke,which looks like a masterfully executed japanese sumi-e brush stroke.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43261_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
