        {
          "id": "docx-n45-a9bbe13ce0d92f79588d39a3",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the path the cat is sliding on is a thin,sharp ribbon of black ink that cuts diagonally across the lower half of the composition. splashes and droplets of ink burst from where the cat’s paws touch the path,conveying speed and friction. beneath this main path,there are faint,delicate,thin ink outlines suggesting abstract waves or wind currents,rendered in a clean manga-style line art that adds depth without cluttering the minimalist aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43262_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
