        {
          "id": "docx-n45-f8dfce52cb42ee3438a8e72e",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the style combines modern japanese anime aesthetics with traditional ink-wash painting techniques. the lines are sharp and precise,yet organic and fluid. the contrast is absolute,relying entirely on deep carbon black and pure paper white,with subtle grey washes used only for minor shading. the lighting is harsh and direct,creating stark,graphic reflections on the glossy ink surfaces. the atmosphere is energetic,elegant,and filled with a sense of swift,effortless motion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_43263_自然语言.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
