          "id": "docx-n45-e0cd7ab4e1c818b960110929",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a three-panel anime-style illustration set beneath a deep blue night sky,with strong chiaroscuro,rich tonal depth,and a vivid contrast between cool ambient light and warm sparkler glow. in the top panel,girl1appears in a centered half-length composition,leaning slightly forward with one hand raised beside her face while the other holds a glowing sparkler in front of her chest. she smiles gently as she watches the scattering sparks. deep navy and cobalt-blue shadows surround her,while concentrated golden-orange light illuminates her face,hands,and the edges of her figure. pink-white bokeh and small glowing particles drift through the darker background,making the warm light appear brighter and more dimensional.",
          "description": "",
