        {
          "id": "docx-n45-bf05e6cf222735f822fa579b",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "the middle panel presents girl2 from a slightly tilted side angle in a head-and-shoulders close-up. her face,neck,collar,shoulders,and part of her upper chest are clearly visible within the frame as she holds a brilliant sparkler near the lower-left corner and looks toward it. the warm amber light strongly illuminates the side of her face closest to the sparkler,while the opposite side falls into cool blue and dark indigo shadow. bright sparks,soft pink highlights,and glowing reflections cross the foreground,creating a clear separation between the warm illuminated areas and the cool nocturnal surroundings. the framing feels intimate and contemplative,with dramatic yet delicate lighting.",
          "description": "",
