        {
          "id": "docx-n45-bdc5ec329107002d94dd0255",
          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "in the bottom panel,girl1and girl2 stand together at the center of a wide composition. they are shown mostly from behind,with their backs facing the viewer as they stand extremely close to one another. their heads turn slightly toward each other,bringing their faces nearly into contact,while their arms remain lowered naturally rather than wrapped around each other. large white-gold fireworks bloom behind them,casting a powerful warm backlight between their figures,while the surrounding sky remains deep blue and violet. their silhouettes are outlined by pale gold,pink,and icy blue rim light,with darker shadows preserving the depth of their forms. floating luminous particles and blurred reflections fill the foreground,creating a romantic,dreamlike atmosphere with pronounced light-dark contrast and a striking balance of warm and cool colors.",
          "description": "",
