          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a monochromatic,abstract illustration from a profile camera angle,depicting a silhouette of a person standing in the middle of the image,with a large,dark umbrella floating above them,creating a surreal and dreamlike atmosphere. the person appears to be a child,with no specific age or gender,and is facing away from the viewer,giving a sense of mystery and isolation. the umbrella is suspended above their head,with swirling swirls and dots adding to the surreal and dreamlike quality of the artwork. the background is a gradient of light grey and white,with subtle hints of darker grey,creating a sense of depth and dimension. the person is wearing a dark cloak,and their face is obscured by the umbrella,giving a sense of isolation and mystery. the overall style is reminiscent of a dark fantasy novel,with a monochromatic and abstract feel. woman,solo,looking at viewer,black hair,standing,full body,sky,from behind,umbrella,silhouette,abstract,dotted face,black umbrella",
