          "alias": "自然语言",
          "prompt": "a cinematic underwater farewell scene featuring girl,preserving her iconic character design and recognizable silhouette. her lifeless body rests peacefully on an ancient abyssal stone platform,surrounded by quiet deep-sea ruins and drifting marine snow. she remains unmistakably herself: long pale-green hair spreads gently through the water,the twin looped buns behind her pointed elf ears slowly unraveling into flowing strands. her large jagged dark gray dragon horns rise from her head,their golden inner markings still glowing faintly like the last remaining trace of her life. her half-lidded blue eyes are closed in peaceful silence,her expression calm and composed rather than suffering. the silver headpiece across her forehead catches the faint underwater light. her black high-neck collar,metallic clasps,and blue-white angular bodice remain intact,with the golden-brown harness details and decorative cords drifting naturally with the current. the massive black arm cuff on her left arm,decorated with flame-like protrusions and gold-white ornaments,rests beside her as a final reminder of her strength. from her body rises her final dragon spirit — not a separate creature,but the pure manifestation of si herself. a translucent ethereal dragon formed from her own silhouette,carrying the shape of her horns,her flowing green hair,and fragments of her armor design within its luminous body. the dragon's scales resemble layers of crystal glass and aurora light,glowing with sapphire blue,pale jade,and warm golden energy. its eyes mirror her own calm blue gaze. the spirit dragon slowly ascends above her,curling through the dark ocean like a celestial ribbon. every movement releases countless glowing particles,like fragments of her memories dissolving into the sea. the golden markings from her horns transform into streams of warm light,weaving through the cold blue abyss and creating a contrast between farewell and rebirth. around her,the deep ocean remains realistic and silent: ancient rocks covered with sparse algae,tiny bioluminescent organisms drifting in the water,distant silhouettes of deep-sea creatures passing through the darkness. no fantasy flowers,no impossible scenery — only the immense scale of the ocean witnessing a final transformation. a single beam of pale cyan sunlight descends from the unreachable surface,passing through the translucent dragon spirit and scattering into thousands of glowing rays. the contrast between her still body below and her ascending dragon soul above creates a solemn,beautiful moment of transcendence. japanese mono no aware,quiet farewell,the beauty of impermanence. ultra cinematic underwater photography,realistic water physics,volumetric god rays,ethereal lighting,refined anime realism,delicate textures,deep emotional atmosphere,masterpiece composition.",
          "description": "",
